  "question": {
    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;is the greatest term in the sequence&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>147</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>147</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>We know that, for increasing function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So, differentiating the given function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>147</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>441</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>147</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>441</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>147</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>441</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>147</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>441</mn></math></p><p>Now for maxima/minima&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>441</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>Maximum value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>64</mn><mn>403</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>125</mn><mn>772</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
